            "body": "> Personally, I just can't imagine preferring the `foo [bar ]baz` bahavior over `foo [bar] baz` with the `w` and the cursor on the b.\n\nThen not selecting a target with trailing whitespace is the most straightforward suggestion:\n\n- `sae]` (i.e. use `e` instead of `w`) will select till the `e`nd of the word.\n- `saiw]` will select the inner word.",
